hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15693","Affan narrated to us, Abd al-Wahid ibn Ziyad narrated to us, Asim al-Ahwal narrated to us, Kurayb ibn al-Harith ibn Abi Musa narrated to us, from Abi Burdah ibn Qays, the brother of Abu Musa al-Ashari, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: O Allah, make the extinction of my nation in Your path by stabbing and plague."
